Text_SeismicTossTeach::
    .string "Most of what was built is gone.\p"
    .string "We keep what we can and label the\n"
    .string "rest unknown.\p"
    .string "That should make you look harder,\n"
    .string "not look away.\p"
    .string "Speaking of which. Shall I teach\n"
    .string "one of yours EQUATE?$"

Text_SeismicTossDeclined::
    .string "No?\n"
    .string "You will be back.$"

Text_SeismicTossWhichMon::
    .string "Which one wants it?$"

Text_SeismicTossTaught::
    .string "Keep looking.\n"
    .string "That is the whole of the method.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WhatsSpecialAboutMoonStone::
    .string "A REFLECTION.\p"
    .string "It looks like a rock to me.\p"
    .string "They say it changes what a daemon\n"
    .string "compiles to. I do not see how.\p"
    .string "The card says not seeing how is not\n"
    .string "the same as it not being so.\p"
    .string "I do not like the card.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BoughtColorTVForMoonLanding::
    .string "I bought a colour set to watch it\n"
    .string "go up.\p"
    .string "We all saw the same picture at the\n"
    .string "same moment.\p"
    .string "That had never happened before.\p"
    .string "Everyone my age tells it the same\n"
    .string "way. The card counts that as one\l"
    .string "account, not thousands.\p"
    .string "It does not say we are wrong. It\n"
    .string "says we could not tell.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_RunningSpaceExhibitThisMonth::
    .string "The upstairs exhibit changes every\n"
    .string "month.\p"
    .string "This one is KNOWN FAULTS. It is\n"
    .string "about distance, and about the\l"
    .string "distance you think you have.\p"
    .string "A researcher from Blanche wrote\n"
    .string "the cards. She is collecting them.\p"
    .string "Into a module, she said. As though\n"
    .string "a fault were a part.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AskedDaddyToCatchPikachu::
    .string "I want a SPIKE.\p"
    .string "Dad says they are hard to keep\n"
    .string "bound. I do not care.\p"
    .string "There is a card about wanting a\n"
    .string "thing so much it starts to look\l"
    .string "likely. I read it twice.\p"
    .string "I still want a SPIKE.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PikachuSoonIPromise::
    .string "A SPIKE. Soon.\n"
    .string "I did promise.\p"
    .string "I have said soon for two years.\p"
    .string "There is a card about that one.\n"
    .string "I go the long way round.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_SpaceShuttle::
    .string "SHUTTLE MODEL. Scale 1:144.\p"
    .string "KNOWN FAULT: it answers every\n"
    .string "question you can think to ask it.\p"
    .string "Nobody asked it what it weighed.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_MeteoriteThatFellOnMtMoon::
    .string "A stone that fell on Deadstack.\p"
    .string "It is thought to be a REFLECTION.\n"
    .string "Nobody has taken it apart.\p"
    .string "KNOWN FAULT: it has been called\n"
    .string "one for so long that the calling is\l"
    .string "now the evidence.$"


@  lineage 3b: "the harder I tried to open the door, the less real it became…
@  until it changed back into mere dots and lines." Benchmark 1's lesson as an
@  event, and the card states it as a hardware fault.
PewterCity_Museum_2F_Text_TheDisplayUnit::
    .string "DISPLAY UNIT. From the drawing\n"
    .string "office, SLATE.\p"
    .string "KNOWN FAULT: the harder an\n"
    .string "operator worked at a thing on it,\l"
    .string "the less of a thing it drew.\p"
    .string "It ended as dots and lines, which\n"
    .string "is all it had ever been.$"

@  lineage 3b: the Guardian is called Hunter on the evidence of a plaid
@  shirt. "I was wrong to assume." A label applied from outside, and wrong.
PewterCity_Museum_2F_Text_TheSortingFrame::
    .string "SORTING FRAME. From the freight\n"
    .string "office, SLATE.\p"
    .string "KNOWN FAULT: shown a marking it\n"
    .string "had seen before, it assigned the\l"
    .string "purpose it had seen beside it.\p"
    .string "It was right often enough that\n"
    .string "nobody checked the markings.$"
